    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d563">

                <pb facs="0565" n="1299" sameAs="frus:frus1895p2/pg1299"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Terrell to Mr. Olney.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-11-12"><hi rendition="#italic">November 12, 1895</hi></date>.
                        (Received Nov. 25.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 669.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to inclose a statement of
                    the case of Creecor Arakelian, with a memorandum furnished in July last by the
                    Rev. H. O. Dwight.</p>
                <p>The release of the man being accomplished, I did not forward it, but do so now
                    that you may be in possession of this paper, should a demand for indemnity be
                    contemplated.</p>
                <p>The pressure upon my time at this juncture of affairs here will, I hope, excuse
                    me from copying.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">A. W. Terrell.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>




                <xi:include href="d563-a1.xml" xpointer="d563-a1"/>
